# Dead store elimination (Phase 7a): a global RMW is frameless and goes
# load/inc/store with no intermediate slot store.
present ; Function: global_increment \(framesize=0,
in global_increment: present lda\.w g_counter\n\tinc a\n\tsta\.w g_counter\n\trtl
in global_increment: absent tsa
# A function with a phi keeps its frame...
present ; Function: phi_loop \(framesize=[1-9]
# ...and the phi args keep their slots: two moves precede the back-edge.
in phi_loop: present sta \d+,s\n\tlda \d+,s\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tjmp @for_cond
